{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼いめちぇん／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーこの前まで髪伸ばそうとか\n言ってたのになんか\n気が変わっちゃって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うそです。\nなんちゃってボブだよ。\nわかるか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛遊ばせるの楽しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかこれ初めてやってみた！\n後ろ髪ぐっちゃぐちゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木ここ収録がありましたー\nお楽しみに♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春休み何か予定あるんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変わらず乃木充できたらなあって\n思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネックレス素敵だなぁ。\nこうゆうのってパーツを\nいろいろ買ってきて\nインスピレーションで\n組み合わせてくの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何となく頭の中でイメージして\n材料買って作っていくけど、\n途中で変えたりもするよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし乃木坂４６に入っていなくて\n好きなひとができたらどうしますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルとか目指してなかったら\nたぶんJK充実させてたんだろうな。\nきっと学校くらいしか楽しみが\nなかったと思うし！\n恋愛もしてたんじゃないかな。\n想像できないけど笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はアイドルになって、\nこうやって過ごしてるけど...\n私は幸せ者です。とても楽しいです。\n私が変わった一つの原点だもの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近嬉しかったことは何ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラマに出ること\n握手会やコメントで\nはじめましての方が増えたこと\nかわいいお店見つけたこと\nトマトとアボカドいっぱい食べたこと\nドラッグストアのおばちゃんに\nほめられたこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいあるねん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪を切るときは雑誌とか見せて\n切ってもらいますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーどのくらい切るかによる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかみたいなテイストの\n洋服を着たいんだけどどんなのを\n買えばいいのかわかんないので\n教えて下さい♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もわからない。\n着たいって思ったものが\nこれなんだけどなんていうですかね。\n...古風なのがすきかなあ。\n古着屋行くといいよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒールとかあんまり\n履かなかったタイプでしょ？\n最近趣味が変わってきた？\nそれとも、色んなジャンルに\n興味が出てきたのかな...？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超高いのはあんま履かないね。\nでも履くときゃ履くよ！\n趣味は変わってないよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短いの着ても\n高いヒール靴履いても私は私！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレエで爪先立ちで踊ったり\nしていたのに、ヒールの靴は恐いの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなた！\nそれとこれとは違うわよっ笑\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな勘違いしてたけど、\n切るのは前髪だけよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/24/3548310/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}